      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough doctors and welcoming reception"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise Dr. Glantz, Dr. Carmellini, Dr. Christensen, and the support staff for being warm, attentive, and unhurried. Pet owners appreciate thorough health explanations and proactive follow-ups that guide preventative decisions for their companions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comfortable environment for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how accommodating the clinic is for reactive dogs and anxious cats, offering private rooms and tasty treats during injections. Cat owners specifically commend the gentle handling techniques that make routine wellness checks and nail trims stress-free."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable wellness exams and diagnostics"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight thorough diagnostic evaluations, successful dental cleanings, and proactive nutritional planning that improved senior pet health. Detailed after-visit summaries help owners track routine vaccinations, lab panels, and long-term treatment strategies."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the Wellness Center differ from the Urgent Care clinic?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The Wellness Center focuses on scheduled preventative visits, annual vaccines, and routine care across the street from the urgent hospital."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What is the clinic appointment confirmation policy?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Appointments require advance confirmation two days prior to your scheduled visit to avoid automatic cancellation."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can anxious or reactive pets be accommodated?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note staff quickly escorts nervous pets into quiet private rooms with soft bedding to minimize stress."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are integrative veterinary therapies offered?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients mention holistic and integrative options such as veterinary acupuncture and herbal consultations for senior pets."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
